# Scratch files from screenshot/asset generation. These live in the repo root only because
# @font-face needs them served same-origin; a reflexive `git add .` would otherwise deploy
# the generator page and raw captures to GitHub Pages.
_*.html
_*.png

# Local git worktrees. A worktree created inside the repo gets committed as an orphaned
# gitlink (mode 160000) with no .gitmodules entry, which makes actions/checkout fail its
# post-job cleanup with "No url found for submodule path" on every single deploy.
.worktrees/
